# First-plan onboarding

Important onboarding path: when a user has an empty (untouched) non-sample plan,
force them through naming, then the multi-step plan editor, until the plan is
created. Same shell as later "new plan" / "edit plan", with dismiss locked.

## Flow

```
CalculatorHome gates
  -> useUI.openFirstRun()          # nameModal mode "firstRun"
  -> PlanNameModal (forced)
  -> confirmPlanName               # renames active blank plan
  -> PlanModal mode "new", draftId null   # forced wizard
  -> finishPlanModal / commitActive
       authenticated -> close
       anonymous invite guest -> createAccount (or register fallback)
       other anonymous -> login
  -> strategyPanel tour (left sidebar, once modals are closed)
```

`openNewPlan` can also enter `firstRun` when the active plan is already an
untouched blank (avoids stacking another empty draft).

